<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10260" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">congestĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		id., lit. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a bringing together;</i> hence, <i>a
				heaping up, accumulation</i> (rare and not ante-Aug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In abstr.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">terrae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr.
					6, 8, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Pall. Mart. 1, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stercorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 33, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">enumerationis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 5, 15 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">honorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mamert. Grat. Act. ad Julian. 22</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			concr., that which is <i>heaped up, a heap, mass,
			pile</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 19, 2, 57</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
